## ✅ Cleaner Version (Optional)

```python
from collections import Counter

class Solution:
    def maxFreqSum(self, s: str) -> int:
        vowels = set('aeiou')
        freq_vow = Counter()
        freq = Counter()

        for c in s.lower():
            if c in vowels:
                freq_vow[c] += 1
            else:
                freq[c] += 1

        return (max(freq.values()) if freq else 0) + (max(freq_vow.values()) if freq_vow else 0)
```

